{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c0527cff-cb96-54fc-8457-c398ddaf36fe",
    "name": "Student Management API",
    "description": "\nStudent Management API with **two versions** running side by side.\n\n| Version | Status | Differences |\n|---|---|---|\n| `/api/v1` | **deprecated**, sunset 2027-05-31 | plain array, no pagination, basic fields |\n| `/api/v2` | current | pagination (`page`, `limit`, `links`), filters, department and enrolment count |\n\nEvery v1 response carries `Deprecation`, `Sunset` and `Link: rel=\"successor-version\"` headers.\n\n### Errors\n`404` not found, `409` conflict (duplicate email), `422` validation failed.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "131d8bdd-3b69-5430-9f84-468f2aa4d453",
      "name": "v2",
      "description": "**Current** version. Use this for all new work.",
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "183ad315-3556-5722-8c1d-b2d97e3f31d8",
          "name": "Create Student",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(201); });",
                  "pm.test(\"Responds in under 1000 ms\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000); });",
                  "pm.test(\"Body is JSON\", function () { pm.response.to.be.json; });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"student_id\", pm.response.json().id);   // reuse in later requests"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v2/students",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v2",
                "students"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Create Student",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Aarav Sharma\",\n  \"email\": \"{{$randomEmail}}\",\n  \"branch\": \"CSE\",\n  \"enrollment_date\": \"2024-08-01\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "85671128-8962-55f8-bbb5-61e7ee0af0ec",
          "name": "List students (paginated, filterable)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test(\"Responds in under 1000 ms\", function () { pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000); });",
                  "pm.test(\"Body is JSON\", function () { pm.response.to.be.json; });",
                  "pm.test(\"Has pagination fields\", function () {",
                  "    const b = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(b).to.have.all.keys(\"items\", \"page\", \"limit\", \"total\", \"total_pages\", \"links\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v2/students?page=1&limit=10",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v2",
                "students"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "branch",
                  "value": "CSE",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "CSE, ECE, IT, ME or CE"
                },
                {
                  "key": "department_id",
                  "value": "1",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "filter by department"
                },
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "aarav",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "matches name or email"
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": ""
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10",
                  "disabled": false,
                  "description": ""
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "List students (paginated, filterable)"
          }
        },
        {
